{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"The malformed-index cases now reach the required `:manifest-defect` result with the manifest address preserved. The totality test covers 11 keys × 8 values and checks both defect results and thrown exceptions. I’ve also found the L5 assertions for JVM and Node processes, all four VMs, undeclared principals, and bad signatures. The reported lane totals remain runtime claims; static review can verify coverage, but cannot certify those runs."}}
